Still 1.2.0. Tapping the helmet is gone; silence takes its place.

It never worked and it cannot: a hands-free link removes the very things that tell a tap from the road. So the way back is not another tap. Three taps on the phone open the microphone, the helmet carries the conversation, and thirty seconds in which you have not spoken hands it back. Adjustable in Settings.

Taps on the phone now play three rising notes, one each: a chord when all three land.
